        <mxCell id="Z0UnOgVCAGFzgoVVoHJn-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="1.&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Practice randomly with selectable question counts (35, 50, 80, All).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;2.&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Practice sequentially by chapter, fetched in paginated batches of 10.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3.&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Filter questions by status: Practised, Unpractised, and Wrong Answered.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;4.Provide sub-filters for questions answered wrong once, twice, or more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;5.Display dynamic, filtered question counts for all filter categories.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;6.Track all user progress and answer history.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;7.Provide immediate visual feedback (red/green) and explanations for answers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;8.Show a final score modal with a reminder to practice mistakes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
